<title>ITALY: Ukraine Int. to launch Rome-Kiev all-cargo flight.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Int. to launch Rome-Kiev all-cargo flight.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine International Airlines will launch a weekly Antonov AN 12 Rome-Kiev all-cargo flight on April I, airline sources said.</p>
<p>The service will provide up to 18 tonnes or 80 cubic metres and the Distal &amp; ITR group will act as general sales agent, they added.</p>
<p>In 1996, Urkaine International carried 85 tonnes ex-Rome on passenger flights. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
